    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25431275da5e34eaa5d8990e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那么，我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "261f70482d0af7dab527339c80dabfc34a0068ab5c0e15752ad49399b7369b52",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085200.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        51,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/51/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:722f08a2b1d2cb387980bfd8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "面对独自背负一切的她，\n我只能挤出这句话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc87ae94952a5f6c612dc6385c7de7d3e1dc5b3cdf10a1f0dafc35c1ab026b67",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085200.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        52,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/52/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ef33f215241df5d98f9f644",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但她却看都不看一眼，\n迅速地进入了赛场。\n不仅如此──",
      "source_fingerprint": "df236a2f31b817e50a07a26c10dec47c8d2ebffa18d7dd09bfae822df353badc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085200.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:893dc008d8aa9b90de5bf258",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "议员A",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f6663bf36f1e1e9b16e180bf325a2cf67428eca64c644d82f83ccaaaaf6ea99",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085200.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9bb6f28117218739e906922",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──让我们用掌声祝福\n第一红宝石小姐盛大绚丽地启程！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea2778b9896bb184b35f44eda30fde92211d222217220b456b648ad8d33122c7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085200.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:473120210f88b747a049c842",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（……呃，那是谁！？）",
      "source_fingerprint": "33ddfd3260db263b04af39b6820ed29d111fe9d11ba9a8124882d94ae4af0f15",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085200.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:098c4f343bb943cbddc6e6e0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（啪啪啪……！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fd1726ea60b4a3e93ed6132143462b79dfd10f390fd160821797cab8978433d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085200.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5858830fd53b61b272372583",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这位不速之客是最近声势看涨的政治人物。\n他没有先约时间，便带着跟班直接进来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "86cbfecda12b57d5593e3103aecdad1907fe846cdfdfd5125d8361c4ebfb8368",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085200.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93984748e847f19dac98a1ad",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向出道战",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ea754365577b70c3247fb413fa7b90388e1e4a185a1da5f6c50ef25fe13c496",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085200.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6626e35cc4d3eb686af2d2d5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“赛马娘赛”当天。\n第一红宝石晋升至经典级后，\n注目度也随之水涨船高。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cd5fe9bf84839a9a1c6ec94c0881b727858c6702a5db2bcb8a728dfdd69abce",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23e75220df3a0b504ef99308",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "观众A",
      "source_fingerprint": "eee86b64dc7889c9a8a0c3464472500fce48b2487b81ae5e25e0e3845b56d9ef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb1f5d4d741e2d4527645b6c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "喔喔，真热闹呢～！\n大家果然都是来看“华丽一族”的吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b24bd4446de81f5d399a02d701a3838d4fae6b456fadf6b75a608cf4db7b3924",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfad74a3da1e01dc6de67875",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不知她对其他参赛者抱着什么想法？\n我感到好奇，于是决定直接询问──",
      "source_fingerprint": "45b206f340d106434b773b7f7e12aa85830c785ebf7a344124bd3102dd9f2ada",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1791d4885aae3948bcf9df1d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我不是那个意思……",
      "source_fingerprint": "754509375b50de75db876fbdc490a8ff4e6e8ec326502fe9530ff11f5c9bc393",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abf2245ae9d4c21ed638b868",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b56cd884b7441b8b32119740e379b8bc7aa840838b1c62bd9418c4a41cbf2b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f58c5fd56478fcd474a877c7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们应该已全面分析过每位参赛者。\n请问还有其他悬念吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "336acc60a2fc355082c9e67b34c2212f3d30cdd22e7868ab2c4b12fb4911f341",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:268c79763ba5c7376033fc8d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b56cd884b7441b8b32119740e379b8bc7aa840838b1c62bd9418c4a41cbf2b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04a291602b2f95cf9ef5b482",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……当然，我很尊敬每一位来到这里的人，\n并且视她们为比赛的对手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "31dff52814ca793265248f6f6fc45998ea1b4326910343d4be11480eda8310c6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97d41c179c4aa441e8d97a0e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b56cd884b7441b8b32119740e379b8bc7aa840838b1c62bd9418c4a41cbf2b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3838188a3bd4e0bbb3863284",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过，除此之外便没有更多感情。\n自己真正该迎战的只有自己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "245a557f9f3a6f52f97f06c878d9977f3ab4ee0e6934f16cf66d90eba5e29770",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c34c3875acc3f24ed09da034",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想她的意思应该是……唯一的劲敌\n就是自己吧。很符合她那自律的作风。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2315501ed19a468a103569edba77c2835c8d23365b7735d86f8048e9bc99747c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46df58b05adad88191b71704",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "！",
      "source_fingerprint": "631157c15452e8cefd925437a26f1d016b1a5d7575f9234fd0bf7aff0369e63d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a9ffa6a777e595be2239564",
      "kind": "story",
